  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "Krita: free open-source digital painting and graphics tool",
  "text": "Open, edit, and export layered graphics without paying a recurring subscription. Getting a layered PSD from a client when you lack a Photoshop license halts your project immediately. Basic image viewers flatten graphic layers into static bitmaps, preventing you from adjusting typography or isolating graphics. Krita opens complex PSD files, preserving transparent layers, blending modes, and filter masks for seamless editing. You handle demanding client deliverables without costly software subscriptions.",
